# promise: #600
# Arc's Duplicate on a favorite's menu and on a split's menu (GitHub #600): the tab rows' menu had it,
# the favorite tile's and the split's did not. A favorite's copy is a favorite of the same page right
# after it; a split's copy is the whole split right after it, opened on the pane focused in the original.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}

cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=fav
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 1
cra://action/favoriteTab
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=left
cra://action/addSplitView
cra://navigate?url=${PAGE}?n=right
wait 1
cra://action/favoriteTab
wait 1

cra://debug?favoriteMenu=1&label=tab
expect-log favorite menu tab: Remove from Favorites\|Rename…\|Mute\|Edit Pinned URL…\|Replace Pinned URL with Current \(off\)\|Duplicate\|Copy Link\|
cra://debug?favoriteMenu=1&label=tab-copy&run=Duplicate
expect-log favorite menu tab-copy favorites: n=fav n=fav n=left\+n=right open: n=fav$
wait 1

cra://debug?favoriteMenu=3&label=split
expect-log favorite menu split: Remove from Favorites\|──\|Separate All Tabs\|.*\|Rename…\|──\|Duplicate\|Move to ▸\|
cra://debug?favoriteMenu=3&label=split-copy&run=Duplicate
expect-log favorite menu split-copy favorites: n=fav n=fav n=left\+n=right n=left\+n=right open: n=right$
